      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLIDE CITY (1) is yet to miss the placings here in an excellent record which boasts two wins. Comes off a (19.09) win last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in a Grade 6 over 350m at this track. Makes strong appeal on best. HAYDEN'S GIFT (3) boasts a strong record this course with four wins and three minors from 10 tries. Below best last time at Q Lakeside (20.30) in a Grade 5, finishing a 6 length sixth. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. EGYPTIAN QUEEN (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (30.57) in a Grade 4/5 at Taree Super Track. Has never missed the frame at the trip from five starts. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. KAIRANGA STORM (6) raced on the pace and got home last start. Hard to beat again.",
